{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golftacular! is mini-golf\u2026. barely. Mix party game chaos and dumb fun with precision and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744510/extras/d6878a43b184b7b79cdc1c9b38ac23c6.avif?t=1757959733\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players take turns as Tortillo, Chuck, Fin, Poop, Papa, Mama, Claude, and Frend, each one aiming for the hole while unleashing chaos on anyone foolish enough to stand in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy endless replayability with dozens of handcrafted courses and thousands of possible item combos. Items shake up everything: turn the course into your personal parkour playground or an obstacle-filled nightmare for your opponents. Call in airstrikes, play rock-paper-scissors, give your ball wings, place portals\u2026 and that\u2019s just the tip of the iceberg.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items, Items, Items </strong>- Use items for game breaking abilities and combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ear Candy Radio </strong>- Bumping original sound track</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Express yourself </strong>- Pick from a cast of whackos\u2026 which one are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play it your way</strong> - Play with keyboard &amp; mouse or controllers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not enough controllers? No Problem! </strong>- Pass and play mode lets you share</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No friends? No problem! </strong>- Tackle challenging courses alone in single player puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744510/extras/d6878a43b184b7b79cdc1c9b38ac23c6.avif?t=1757959733\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744510?t=1757959733","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744510/e7f946605bc41a2bd548c6a5beea1b684e97d28e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757959733","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744510/b750b9f620878413e4fbaef94b6f8d6953f486fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757959733","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744510/b750b9f620878413e4fbaef94b6f8d6953f486fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757959733","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golftacular! is mini-golf\u2026. barely. Mix party game chaos and dumb fun with precision and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744510/extras/d6878a43b184b7b79cdc1c9b38ac23c6.avif?t=1757959733\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players take turns as Tortillo, Chuck, Fin, Poop, Papa, Mama, Claude, and Frend, each one aiming for the hole while unleashing chaos on anyone foolish enough to stand in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy endless replayability with dozens of handcrafted courses and thousands of possible item combos. Items shake up everything: turn the course into your personal parkour playground or an obstacle-filled nightmare for your opponents. Call in airstrikes, play rock-paper-scissors, give your ball wings, place portals\u2026 and that\u2019s just the tip of the iceberg.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items, Items, Items </strong>- Use items for game breaking abilities and combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ear Candy Radio </strong>- Bumping original sound track</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Express yourself </strong>- Pick from a cast of whackos\u2026 which one are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play it your way</strong> - Play with keyboard &amp; mouse or controllers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not enough controllers? No Problem! </strong>- Pass and play mode lets you share</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No friends? No problem! </strong>- Tackle challenging courses alone in single player puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744510/extras/d6878a43b184b7b79cdc1c9b38ac23c6.avif?t=1757959733\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p>","developers":["Both Good"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744510/191a4c86d9a8b0c4232aa7fba3ba6ee090bf1e8d/header.jpg?t=1757959733","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (6th generation) or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Graphics 4400 or be